Maintainer: nm-webui maintainers <ru-ace@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Web UI for NetworkManager
 Web-based UI for managing NetworkManager connections: WiFi, ethernet,
 hotspots and more. The Svelte frontend is embedded in a single static
 Go binary; no web server dependencies required.
